00:05:57.760 --> 00:06:03.200
to kind of force the person to take action&nbsp;
and heed the call to adventure and go on the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:03.200 --> 00:06:08.160
journey at the end of act one so it's not like&nbsp;
you have to have conflict conflict it's like&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:08.160 --> 00:06:13.680
like usually most really great stories depending&nbsp;
on what genre you're writing in I mean if you're&nbsp;&nbsp;

